If you stay until the end,

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.133
you will also see why he got the bounty of $28,000

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:21.233
despite violating Apple bug bounty rules.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.633
Link to the original report is in the description.

00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:25.566
Enjoy!

